  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Marsabit IDPs Project March 2019</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inter ethnic conflicts between Borana and Gabra communities erupted in September 2018 and tension remains high in several villages in Saku, Moyale and North Horr Sub-Counties. The conflicts have so far claimed 28 lives, led to displacement of  people, disruption of learning as several schools have been closed down and led to challenges of accessing food and water. The proposed project proposes to address food insecurity and water scarcity through food distribution and water trucking to affected locations  and peace meeting for conflict resolutions.</narrative>
  </description>
